  "summary": {
    "ja": "細格子で平滑化し、粗格子で滑らかな誤差を補正する幾何学的多重格子法。公開実装は単位正方形の零Dirichlet Poisson問題に対する固定階層のV-cycle。",
    "en": "Geometric multigrid combines fine-grid smoothing with coarse-grid correction of smooth error. The public implementation is a fixed-hierarchy V-cycle for zero-Dirichlet Poisson on the unit square."
  },
